        <mxCell id="n" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;New version replaces on macOS; on Linux and Windows only when the definition differs, and a current one only updates the record. Declined, cancelled, needs approval or elevation, or unavailable: back to the state before. A hold ends when the service answers, the version changes, or Repair or Install is pressed (they run past 3 attempts).&lt;/span&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,system-ui,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fontColor=light-dark(#14171C,#ECEEF1);rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=6;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=light-dark(#C4C7CD,#353A42);fillColor=light-dark(#F0F2F5,#1B1E23);align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="96" y="932" width="1384" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
